  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "Fifth and sixth change hands",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "person-yi-chia-chen-roster-0"
      ],
      "text": "Majkel1337 moves into fifth at 75.56 after gaining 3.75 points since the previous close. ALbert RUehlman advances from eighth to sixth at 72.64, a gain of 1.25. Their improvement pushes the unchanged _hans down to eighth. Tufa Labs still leads at 88.06, Yi-Chia Chen holds second at 84.72 and rabbithole stands third at 80.83, ahead of nvbanana. The challengers have changed the order behind the front four without closing the leading pair’s gap."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Franzen and Chilakala reach the top 25",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "person-daniel-franzen-fact-0",
        "person-daniel-franzen-fact-1",
        "wire-2026-10-20-1156-arc-2-daniel-franzen-surges-to-twenty-fourth",
        "wire-2026-10-20-0758-arc-2-ravi-teja-chilakala-enters-top-twenty-five"
      ],
      "text": "Daniel Franzen gains 10.97 points to reach 57.64 and 24th, nine places above the previous close. Ravi Teja Chilakala adds 12.50 points to reach 55.97 and closes 25th. The wire caught Chilakala at 24th earlier in the day; tonight’s position shows why an advance in score does not guarantee holding the same rank. Both remain below the provisional gold score of 64.72. Franzen’s past ARChitects titles provide context for a recognizable contender returning toward the front, not evidence about how he made this gain."
    },
    {
      "heading": "The climb below the medal line",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-20-1405-arc-2-codjjj-climbs-to-thirty-sixth",
        "wire-2026-10-20-0602-arc-2-matu997-closes-on-gold-line"
      ],
      "text": "codjjj reaches 49.86 and 36th, up 13.33 points and 34 places from the previous close. The afternoon wire used its own rolling comparison when it described a climb from 69th; the edition’s prior-close starting position is 70th. matu997’s morning move to 64.31 left it just short of the gold score. The gold threshold remains 64.72 at this close, so the next meaningful step for that chase is a score gain, not merely a shift in rank."
    }
